{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/32913-x-men-scenariao","id":32913,"title":"X-men Scenariao","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-18T19:17:00-08:00","id":32913,"title":"X-men Scenariao","content":"ANyone ever think about an X-men Scenariao if the Masquerade/Veil / whatever came apart.<br /> <br /> Its suggested in the Gehenna book, as well as in Project Twilight.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on the notion?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T20:49:38-08:00","id":32937,"title":"","content":"A couple years ago I played in MtAw chronicle were the percentage of Awakening dramatically increased and didn't stop, leading to among other things the formation of a large sanctum to teach the scores of newly Awakened, at least those within and around Boston, as well as the Mages deciding that they only option was to come out into the public before things grew further out of hand. It got very X-men-ish by the end.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T07:06:58-08:00","id":33151,"title":"","content":"Thing is Any kind of Registration acts would likely lead to all out war.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T07:30:43-08:00","id":33171,"title":"","content":"Of course it would but at the same time the world was rapidly falling apart. Hundreds of newly Awakened Mages with no idea what was going on, much less their gained power. Then we had the people outright abusing their Magic for their own gain. Banishers going insane, or rather descending further into madness, and basically declaring war on everybody. Both the Pentacle Order and the Seers around the world in a panic. Normal people freaking out at everything. Keeping quiet about things wasn't going to help much when things were on the edge like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T18:45:15-08:00","id":358696,"title":"","content":"Sorry to bump this old thread...<br /> <br /> Curious in such a instance, do you think that Anyone who knew of the existence of supernaturals, and failed to come forward to the government or media, could be reasonably charged with Failing to act to preserve the public safety?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T20:02:57-08:00","id":358764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/32913-x-men-scenariao?p=358696#post358696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry to bump this old thread...<br /> <br /> Curious in such a instance, do you think that Anyone who knew of the existence of supernaturals, and failed to come forward to the government or media, could be reasonably charged with Failing to act to preserve the public safety?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on what supernaturals you're talking about and what they individuals in question knew they were guilty of. If the person just knows that supernatural being ________ exists, but doesn't know that they're eating people or experimenting on them or whatever, then they probably can't be convicted in a fair trial.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T09:25:12-08:00","id":359229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/32913-x-men-scenariao?p=358696#post358696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry to bump this old thread...<br /> <br /> Curious in such a instance, do you think that Anyone who knew of the existence of supernaturals, and failed to come forward to the government or media, could be reasonably charged with Failing to act to preserve the public safety?</div> </div> </div> </div>Reasonably? If there is such a law on the books. Duty to report is a slippery thing and varies massively from jurisdiction to jurisdiction. What jurisdiction were you thinking? Federal? State? A country other than the US with a legal system derived from Common Law? A country with a legal system derived from other bases?<br /> <br /> However, overall, it's probably going to be prosecuted as some form of obstruction. Not a de facto omission. Omissions are a bitch to prosecute and a bitch to police. Most criminal law isn't based on a failure to act, its based on actively committing an offense. The difference between failing to report something (which can and is a crime, sometimes with fun names like &quot;misprison of felony&quot;) and, when asked, deliberately obfuscating or failing to answer. So a person in the know is probably going to get the book thrown at them when the authorities come to ask questions and the person lies as opposed to the authorities finding out about the supernatural independently then proactively seeking out the character because the character knew but didn't tell. <br /> <br /> If you are thinking civil law, though, there is a lot of room for negligence... A reasonable person SHOULD have come forward, the person is question did not and a harm was suffered.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T19:55:03-08:00","id":359832,"title":"","content":"Hmm...Vampire X-men<br /> <br /> Name: Logan<br /> Born: 1860<br /> Embraced: 1890<br /> Sire: Vancouver Methuselah<br /> Generation: 5th<br /> Nature: Survivor<br /> Demeanor: Loner<br /> Physical: Strength 8, Dexterity 6, Stamina 8<br /> Social: Charisma 3, Manipulation 2, Appearance 3<br /> Mental: Perception 4, Intelligence 3, Wits 5<br /> Path: Humanity 6<br /> Willpower: 10<br /> Virtues: Conscience 4, Self Control 3, Courage 5<br /> <br /> Disciplines:<br /> Auspex 1<br /> Fortitude 8 (Lvl 8: Repair the Undead Flesh)<br /> Protean 6 (Lvl 4: Wolverine Form, Lvl 6: Flesh of Marble)<br /> <br /> Talents - Alertness 5, Brawl 6, Investigation 2<br /> Skills - Drive 3, Firearms 4, Melee 4, Stealth 3<br /> Knowledge - Academics 1, Streetwise 3<br /> <br /> Background - Status 3, Resources 1, Herd 1<br /> Haven - Wherever there's bare earth<br /> Mertis - Daredevil, Code of Honor<br /> Flaws - Amnesia<br /> Clan Weakness - Every time a Gangrel frenzies, they gain an animalistic feature. Especially traumatic frenzies can leave permanent marks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2078-alucard","name":"Alucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2078_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"811"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T20:14:29-08:00","id":359835,"title":"","content":"Wouldn't be exactly the same situation, since in X-Men, for the most part mutants are just people trying to get by, with the prejudice being portrayed (depending on the writer) as irrational knee-jerk, or the result of a few &quot;bad&quot; mutants leading to fear of all mutants. Vampires, in contrast, actively feed on humans. Mages are basically schizophrenic, and Uratha are... problematic at best, from a human point of view.<br /> <br /> So the anti-Supernatural perspective would actually be reasonably valid here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T21:34:44-08:00","id":359858,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Alucard, you seem to think <i>very</i> highly of Wolverine <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. I don\u2019t see the need to make the X-men into Methuselahs, though I\u2019m guessing you went that route purely to give him that Fortitude 8 power. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Just for fun:</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Name: Gambit (Remy Etienne LeBeau)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Born: ??</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Embraced: ??</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Sire: Unknown</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Clan: Caitiff</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span styl